OL,3,GNEWSAFamily appears on DIY SOS after
OL,4,Adad's sudden death
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a man who died suddenly
OL,7,Fhas had help renovating their home as
OL,8,Fpart of TV show.
OL,10,FMum Georgina and her three children are
OL,11,Fset to feature on BBC show DIY SOS who
OL,12,Fhelped them renovate their "doer-upper"
OL,13,Fhome which she bought with her husband
OL,14,FChris.
OL,16,FShe said Chris died very suddenly aged
OL,17,F43 in August 2025 and she was left with
OL,18,Fa house in Feniton, Devon which needed
OL,19,F"everything doing".
OL,21,F"It's a house built on something
OL,22,Ftragic," Georgina said.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
